 - Outbound HTTP only via `saleor/core/http_client.py` (`HTTPClient`, SSRF IP filter); semgrep-enforced.
 
+## Age restriction foundation
+- `Product.age_restricted` is a purchase-only signal; do not use it to filter catalogue visibility or availability.
+- `SiteSettings.minimum_age` and `time_zone` define the shop policy; timezone updates accept IANA names only.
+- `User.birthday` is nullable and private: owner self-service plus active-superuser access; writes and superuser reads create value-free customer audit events. `BIRTHDAY_UPDATED` stores actor/target plus `operation=set|clear`; clearing requires `clearBirthday: true`.
+- Pure date policy lives in `saleor/account/age_restriction.py`; checkout/order enforcement belongs at purchase funnels.
+
 ## Testing
 - pytest config: `setup.cfg [tool:pytest]` — xdist `-n auto --dist loadgroup`, settings `saleor.tests.settings`, sockets disabled (localhost/cache allowed), VCR replay-only (`--record-mode=none`; record with `--vcr-record=once`), `asyncio_mode=auto`. Markers: `integration`, `e2e`, `slow` (`--run-slow`).
 - Test settings (`saleor/tests/settings.py`): eager Celery, `PLUGINS=[]`, test RSA key, writer guard raising, IP filter/breaker off.
